Trivecta is a modified build of Spirula Studio. The modifications are limited
to the user interface and branding:

  * product name and window title changed to "Trivecta"
  * a light (white) colour theme
  * a larger base UI font size
  * a "Welcome To The Trivecta" headline on the home screen
  * a dedicated "Open 3D" button for the splat viewer

The full corresponding source, including these modifications, is provided in
the `trivecta/` directory of this repository and distributed under the
GNU General Public License v3.0 (see `trivecta/LICENSE`).

